public static int again(int x){ 
  int result = 0; 
  if( x <= 0 ) 
    result = 2; 
  else 
    result = 2 + again( x - 1 ); 
  return result; 
} 
QUESTION  28 



What is the running time of method process? Assume 
N equals data.length. Choose the most restrictive 
correct answer. 

A. 
O(N2) 
B. 
O(NlogN) 
C. 
O(N3) 

D. 
O(N2logN) 
E. 
O(N) 
public static void process(int[] data, 
                          int min, 
                          int max){ 
  int result = 0; 
  for( int val : data ) 
    if( val >= min && val <= max ) 
      result++; 
    else 
      result--; 

  for(int i = 0; i < data.length; i++) 
    data[i] += result; 
}

